WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Why are you pulling me?

2
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:07,220
Is this also what you arranged?

3
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:08,420
Let’s first say that I only have 100,000 yuan.

4
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,060
I'm not responsible for the overspending, it's not us.

5
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:11,740
Maybe someone else is setting off fireworks here

6
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,260
Someone else put it

7
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:17,170
How much does this cost? Brothers, look at this first.

8
00:00:17,410 --> 00:00:19,290
This scene must not be missed

9
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:26,970
Don’t people know? Let’s talk about it first.

10
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,090
The fireworks have been set off for you

11
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:29,330
You can’t let go from now on

12
00:00:33,530 --> 00:00:34,610
Please

13
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:36,850
The fish will definitely be obedient from now on

14
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:42,210
I definitely won't go against you. Don't say anything this time.
